{
  "note": "One entry per server. The id is what the menus show and what VPN_PROFILE names. The DNS (VPN_DNS) and the MTU (VPN_MTU) of .env.global are applied to every server without being written here; an entry may carry \"dns\", \"mtu\", or a peer \"persistent_keepalive\" of its own when a server needs one. Both keys and the address come from the WireGuard configuration your provider gives you. gmake vpn_edit_profiles opens this file.",
